{"title":"Regressing With The King’s Power","synopsis":"Dari studio yang mengerjakan Solo Leveling dan Omniscient Readers Viewpoint\nAku akan memakan semua skillmu\nPersetan dengan Awakening gak jelas ini\nAku bukan pecundang\nKim Taehyun adalah orang yang level awakeningnya masih belum ditentukan\ndiperlakukan seperti pecundang karena dia gagal melakukan awakening\nAkan tetapi Dia berhasil awakening kemampuannya pada saat kematiannya ketika ada suatu gerbang dibuat yang mengarahkannya pada sang raja\nSetelah itu Taehyun yang telah kembali dengan kekuatan raja mendapatkan kemampuan baru yang disebut Predation\nTaehyun seorang pria berusia 35 tahun mengalami regresi menuju saat ketika dia masih berusia 19 tahun\nSkill telah dilahap Dengan kekuatan ini Aku pasti bisa menjadi yang terhebat","alternative_title":"왕의 힘으로 회귀한다","author":"Ahn So-seol, KIM, Sunghyun","artist":"Redice Studio","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"chapters":[{"id":"778d4355-f219-4f51-a4fb-71bcd1701b6d","number":"140","title":"Chapter 140","date":"2026-05-12","images":[]},{"id":"b99da6a0-a736-4830-bcaa-13900affd5aa","number":"139","title":"Chapter 139","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"80e29f0d-ee00-461f-97eb-45cc1dce291b","number":"138","title":"Chapter 138","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"36c6e75b-d423-443d-9b5f-4d26a143b599","number":"137","title":"Chapter 137","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"2e35c23d-ff89-4743-867d-0b3ed92f5c60","number":"136","title":"Chapter 136","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"d8bc2787-ab67-47bd-9b1b-78228527e21f","number":"135","title":"Chapter 135","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"859d9e05-a188-4ce1-8331-6bdd3ccbdc9c","number":"134","title":"Chapter 134","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"f618624a-6a80-4c16-a9cd-4a777cbf80df","number":"133","title":"Chapter 133","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"9d681531-4a2b-4b7a-ab8b-524838631edc","number":"132","title":"Chapter 132","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"b5b2e2bc-7997-4d00